    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said unto me, Son of man, stand upon thy feet, and I will speak unto thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the spirit entered into me when he spake unto me, and set me upon my feet, that I heard him that spake unto me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said unto me, Son of man, I send thee to the children of Israel, to a rebellious nation that hath rebelled against me: they and their fathers have transgressed against me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.2.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.2.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto this very day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "they are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.2.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.2.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "impudent children and stiffhearted. I do send thee unto them; and thou shalt say unto them, Thus saith the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.2.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.2.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they, whether they will hear, or whether they will forbear, (for they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.2.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.2.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a rebellious house,) yet shall know that there hath been a prophet among them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And thou, son of man, be not afraid of them, neither be afraid of their words, though briers and thorns",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.2.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.2.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with thee, and thou dost dwell among scorpions: be not afraid of their words, nor be dismayed at their looks, though they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.2.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.2.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a rebellious house.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt speak my words unto them, whether they will hear, or whether they will forbear: for they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.2.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.2.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "most rebellious.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But thou, son of man, hear what I say unto thee; Be not thou rebellious like that rebellious house: open thy mouth, and eat that I give thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And when I looked, behold, an hand",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.2.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.2.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sent unto me; and, lo, a roll of a book",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.2.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.2.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "therein;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he spread it before me; and it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.2.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.2.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "written within and without: and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.2.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.2.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "written therein lamentations, and mourning, and woe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
